alice! connected
alice< MOTD Welcome to the test server.
alice< OK welcome
alice> NICK alice
alice< OK nick alice
bob! connected
bob< MOTD Welcome to the test server.
bob< OK welcome
bob> NICK bob
bob< OK nick bob
alice> JOIN #ops
alice< OK join #ops members=1 topic=
bob> JOIN #ops
bob< OK join #ops members=2 topic=
bob> KICK alice
bob< ERR 481 operator only
alice> OPER open-sesame
alice< * bob joined #ops
alice< ERR 464 bad operator token
alice> OPER sesame
alice< OK oper
alice> MOTD Mind the gap.
alice< OK motd set
bob> MOTD
bob< NOTICE the message of the day changed
bob< MOTD Mind the gap.
bob< OK motd
alice> TOPIC #ops staff only
alice< NOTICE the message of the day changed
alice< OK topic
bob> WHO #ops
bob< * alice set the topic of #ops
bob< MEMBERS #ops alice bob
bob< OK who
alice> MSG #ops this goes to the history file
alice< OK msg 1
bob< <#ops> alice: this goes to the history file
alice> KICK nobody
alice< ERR 401 no such nick
alice> KICK bob
alice< OK kick
bob! closed by the server
alice> WHO #ops
alice< * bob left #ops (kicked)
alice< MEMBERS #ops alice
alice< OK who
carol! connected
carol< MOTD Mind the gap.
carol< OK welcome
carol> NICK carol
carol< OK nick carol
alice> SHUTDOWN sesame
alice< OK shutdown
carol< NOTICE server shutting down
carol! closed by the server
alice< NOTICE server shutting down
alice! closed by the server
-- server: history=1
-- endings: quit=0 eof=0 dropped=0 kicked=1 closing=4 broken=0 canceled=0
